touch
Usage: touch [-cham] [-d DATE] [-t DATE] [-r FILE] FILE...

Create empty FILEs, or set their modified time to now.

	-c	Skip files that don't exist
	-h	Don't follow links
	-a	Change only atime
	-m	Change only mod time
	-d DATE	Use DATE, not now
	-t DATE	Use DATE, not now
	-r FILE	Use FILE's date/time
